    {
      "category": "other",
      "field": "fact_1",
      "value": "According to Durkheim, Buddhism is a religion. 'In default of gods, Buddhism admits the existence of sacred things, namely, the four noble truths and the practices derived from them.'",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "source": null,
      "metadata": {
        "chunk_id": "page_0047",
        "chunk_title": "Notes",
        "chunk_order": 46,
        "source_type": "page"
      }
    },
    {
      "category": "other",
      "field": "fact_2",
      "value": "Hinduism is variously defined as a religion, set of religious beliefs and practices, and religious tradition.",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "source": null,
      "metadata": {
        "chunk_id": "page_0047",
