    {
      "category": "other",
      "field": "fact_4",
      "value": "René Guénon in his Introduction to the Study of the Hindu Doctrines (1921 ed.) proposes a definition of the term religion and a discussion of its relevance (or lack of) to Hindu doctrines (part II, chapter 4, p. 58).",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "source": null,
      "metadata": {
